      "title": "&f&lA proper cutting station&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fFarmer’s Delight cutting recipes use their listed tool and output rules. Start with the native board, inspect recipes in JEI and later automate supported cuts with Slice & Dice.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fKeep ingredients and the cutting tool nearby so manual food prep remains easy.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
