      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fObtain a Stove and prepare a place for the kitchen.",
        "",
        "&fUse Farmer’s Delight’s native cooking setup and recipes to prepare repeatable meals. Plan the input supply and finished-meal storage before adding automatic transfers.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fChoose a meal whose ingredients are already renewable in your settlement.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
